{"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://robinsonsland.com/core/misc/icons/e32700/error.svg","alt":"Image removed.","cap":""},{"t":"p","html":"As part of its Holiday tradition, Robinsons Malls will be hosting a series of Christmas Tree and Mall Décor Lighting Events this November to usher in the Holiday Season in its several malls nationwide. The first of many will be held on Friday, November 4 at Robinsons Place Manila. An elaborate indoor 34 -foot and 12 feet in diameter Christmas Tree will stand at the heart of Robinsons Place Manila’s Midtown Atrium. Adorned with large arrangements of different flowers, ornaments and poinsettias in varying shades of purple, green and magenta, this majestic tree will be fully lit with bluish white LED lights and accentuated with large ornate Christmas balls and lighted curliques and drop lights. The Christmas Tree will be mounted on a Baroque-designed base to give the entire display with a more vintage and elegant look. A very special treat is in store for Robinsons Place Manila shoppers and patrons. A 200 square meter skater rink will be installed in the Midtown Atrium from November 4, 2016 to January 31,2017 _ with an entrance fee of P200 per hour person . The school children from Jaime Cardinal Sin Village, Robinsons Malls’ The Gift of Change beneficiary will be treated with an afternoon of games, prizes and surprises and free entrance to the skating rink. To celebrate, a celebrity studded show will be held at 5:30 pm led by Kapmilya stars Hashtags featuring Ronnie Alonte, Zeus Collins, Jameson Blake, Jimboy Martin, Paulo Angeles, Tom Doromal, Ryle Santiago, Nikko Natividad. The official Christmas Tree Lighting will follow with special guests doing the honors of officially lighting the Christmas Tree. On November 5, 6, 11, 12 and 13, a total of 17 Christmas Mall Décor Lighting events will be held all over the Philippines. These will held at Robinsons Magnolia, Robinsons Place Palawan ,Robinsons Sta. Rosa, Robinsons Place Dasmarinas, Robinsons Place Santiago, Robinsons Novaliches. Other ensuing events will held also in Robinsons Place Malolos, Robinsons Place Las Pinas, Robinsons Place Imus, Robinsons Place Antipolo, Robinsons Galleria Cebu, Robinsons Place Angeles, Robinsons Place Lipa, Robinsons Place Gen Trias, Robinsons Place Ilocos, Robinsons Place Pangasinan, and Robinsons Starmills Pampanga."},{"t":"p","html":"<a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/700-501.html\">700-501</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-177.html\">70-177</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-178.html\">70-178</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-243.html\">70-243</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-246.html\">70-246</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-270.html\">70-270</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-346.html\">70-346</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-347.html\">70-347</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-410.html\">70-410</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-411.html\">70-411</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-412.html\">70-412</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-413.html\">70-413</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-417.html\">70-417</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-461.html\">70-461</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-462.html\">70-462</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-463.html\">70-463</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-480.html\">70-480</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-483.html\">70-483</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-486.html\">70-486</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-487.html\">70-487</a> <a href=\"http://www.globalcurrencyservice.com/?exam=1Z0-051.html\">1Z0-051</a> <a href=\"http://fr.bgs.eu/?exam=NS0-157.html\">NS0-157</a> <a href=\"http://ww.caspianpackaging.com/?exam=100-105.html\">100-105</a> , <a href=\"http://fr.bgs.eu/?exam=350-029.html\">350-029</a> <a href=\"http://www.fyzioku